	
Label Root
{
	Son: Network
	Label Network
	{
		Son: Node
		Label Node
		{
			Var: NodeLinks
			Var: TopLink

		}

		Param: numNodes
		Param: numLinks
		Param: typeNet
		Param: expLink
		Param: rho
		Param: avgOutDeg
		Param: linkProb
		Param: nCol
		Param: eightNeigbr
		Var: NewLink
		Var: TotalLinks

	}

	Son: Example
	Label Example
	{
		Son: Pajek
		Label Pajek
		{
			Son: PajNode
			Label PajNode
			{

			}

			Var: PajekInit

		}

		Son: Direct
		Label Direct
		{
			Son: DirNode
			Label DirNode
			{

			}

			Var: DirectInit

		}

		Son: Undir
		Label Undir
		{
			Son: UndNode
			Label UndNode
			{

			}

			Var: UndirInit

		}

		Son: Random
		Label Random
		{
			Son: RandNode
			Label RandNode
			{

			}

			Var: RandomInit

		}

		Son: Renyi
		Label Renyi
		{
			Son: RenyiNode
			Label RenyiNode
			{

			}

			Var: RenyiInit

		}

		Son: Circle
		Label Circle
		{
			Son: CircNode
			Label CircNode
			{

			}

			Var: CircleInit

		}

		Son: SmallW
		Label SmallW
		{
			Son: SWnode
			Label SWnode
			{

			}

			Var: SmallWInit

		}

		Son: ScFree
		Label ScFree
		{
			Son: SFnode
			Label SFnode
			{

			}

			Var: ScFreeInit

		}

		Son: Star
		Label Star
		{
			Son: StarNode
			Label StarNode
			{

			}

			Var: StarInit

		}

		Son: Lattice
		Label Lattice
		{
			Son: LatNode
			Label LatNode
			{

			}

			Var: LatticeInit

		}


	}

	Var: InitNet

}


DATA

Object: Root C	1
Var: InitNet 0 n + d n

Object: Network C	1
Param: numNodes 0 n + n n	1000
Param: numLinks 0 n + n n	10000
Param: typeNet 0 n + n n	1
Param: expLink 0 n + n n	2
Param: rho 0 n + n n	0.1
Param: avgOutDeg 0 n + n n	10
Param: linkProb 0 n + n n	0.01
Param: nCol 0 n + n n	40
Param: eightNeigbr 0 n + n n	1
Var: NewLink 0 s + n n
Var: TotalLinks 0 s + n n

Object: Node C	1
Var: NodeLinks 0 s + n n
Var: TopLink 0 s + n n

Object: Example C	1

Object: Pajek C	1
Var: PajekInit 0 n + n n

Object: PajNode C	1

Object: Direct C	1
Var: DirectInit 0 n + n n

Object: DirNode C	1

Object: Undir C	1
Var: UndirInit 0 n + n n

Object: UndNode C	1

Object: Random C	1
Var: RandomInit 0 n + n n

Object: RandNode C	1

Object: Renyi C	1
Var: RenyiInit 0 n + n n

Object: RenyiNode C	1

Object: Circle C	1
Var: CircleInit 0 n + n n

Object: CircNode C	1

Object: SmallW C	1
Var: SmallWInit 0 n + n n

Object: SWnode C	1

Object: ScFree C	1
Var: ScFreeInit 0 n + n n

Object: SFnode C	1

Object: Star C	1
Var: StarInit 0 n + n n

Object: StarNode C	1

Object: Lattice C	1
Var: LatticeInit 0 n + n n

Object: LatNode C	1

SIM_NUM 1
SEED 1
MAX_STEP 100
EQUATION fun_nets.cpp
MODELREPORT modelreport.html

DESCRIPTION

Object_Root

END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_InitNet
Initialize the net

'InitNet' appears in the equation for: (Never Used).
END_DESCRIPTION

Object_Network
(no description available )
END_DESCRIPTION

Parameter_numNodes
Number of nodes (users) in network
_INIT_
All 1 instances equal to 1000.
END_DESCRIPTION

Parameter_numLinks
Average number of arcs (directed links) per user node (out degree)
_INIT_
All 1 instances equal to 0.
END_DESCRIPTION

Parameter_typeNet
Type of user network initialization:
0 - Reads network from file in Pajek format, according to LSD seed value (1, 2 ...)
1 - Directed random network: numNodes: total nodes, numLinks: number of links in network
2 - Undirected random network: numNodes: total nodes, numLinks: number of links in network
3 - Uniform random network: numNodes: total nodes, avgOutDeg: out links per node
4 - Renyi-Erdos random network: numNodes: total nodes, avgOutDeg: average out links per node
5 - Circle network: numNodes: total nodes, avgOutDeg: out neighbours per node
6 - Small-World network: numNodes: total nodes, avgOutDeg: out neighbours per node, rho: rewires out of total number of links
7 - Power-law network: numNodes: total nodes, avgOutDeg: average out links per node, expLink: power degree
8 - Star network: numNodes: total nodes
9 - Lattice network: numNodes: total nodes, nCol: number of columns in lattice, eightNeigbr: flag to use 8 neighbors instead of 4
_INIT_
All 1 instances equal to 1.
END_DESCRIPTION

Parameter_expLink
Power degree of the scale-free network of users (power-law networks only)
_INIT_
All 1 instances equal to 2.
END_DESCRIPTION

Parameter_rho
Rewiring link probability parameter for the small-world network of users (small-world networks only)
_INIT_
All 1 instances equal to 0.1.
END_DESCRIPTION

Parameter_avgOutDeg
Average out-degree
_INIT_
All 1 instances equal to 10.
END_DESCRIPTION

Parameter_linkProb
Probability of two links connecting (Renyi-Erdos networks)
_INIT_
All 1 instances equal to 0.01.
END_DESCRIPTION

Parameter_nCol
Number of columns in a lattice network
_INIT_
All 1 instances equal to 40.
END_DESCRIPTION

Parameter_eightNeigbr
Flag to use 8 (=1) neighbors instead of 4 (=0)
_INIT_
All 1 instances equal to 1.
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_NewLink
Add one new bidirectional link randomly every time step,
with weight equal to the time

'NewLink' appears in the equation for: (Never Used).
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_TotalLinks
Register the total number of links in network

'TotalLinks' appears in the equation for: (Never Used).
END_DESCRIPTION

Object_Node
(no description available )
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_NodeLinks
Register the total number of links in the node

'NodeLinks' appears in the equation for: (Never Used).
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_TopLink
Register the id of the highest weight link destination for the node
and reduce the weight by one

'TopLink' appears in the equation for: (Never Used).
END_DESCRIPTION

Object_Example
Several example networks in each son object
END_DESCRIPTION

Object_Pajek

END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_PajekInit
Produce the Pajek imported network (net_2.net) example
END_DESCRIPTION

Object_PajNode

END_DESCRIPTION

Object_Direct

END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_DirectInit
Produce the (fully) directed random network example
END_DESCRIPTION

Object_DirNode

END_DESCRIPTION

Object_Undir

END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_UndirInit
Produce the (fully) undirected random network example
END_DESCRIPTION

Object_UndNode

END_DESCRIPTION

Object_Random

END_DESCRIPTION

